la'e ko'a zo'u tu'a lo mapli cu natfe lo se xusra

.i mi na djuno lo du'u makau drani .i pe'i la'e ko'e plixau zmadu

mu'o mi'e ros.

The opening of Magic+Words asserts that ybu is BU near the beginning, but
the example given below contradicts that
broda .y. bu = broda + the letter y

In short, I don't know. Certainly being able to talk about the letter y
easily seems more useful than being allowed to yyyyy in the middle of a bu
construction.

